     "Price ≥ " + str.tostring(ddLevel * 100) + " % under its all-time high, then a close above the prior 20-bar high (reclaim). Stop −25 %, target +" + str.tostring(ddTp * 100) + " %, 90-bar limit.",
     "2-3 pivot lows at the same level (≤ 0.5-1.5 %), ≥ 5 bars apart, after a downtrend; neckline ≥ 2 ATR above. First close above the neckline with ≥ 1.2× volume and a break of structure. Target = neckline + height.",
     "Head ≥ 0.5 ATR under two level shoulders after a downtrend; sloped neckline through the highs between. Close above the neckline with volume. Target = neckline + head depth.",
