     "A parabola through the last 60 closes opens upward (R² ≥ 0.7, bottom in the middle), base ≥ 3 ATR deep, volume dries up then returns. U: close above the left rim (10 candles). Cup & handle: right side back near the rim + a quiet 4-candle handle in the top half; close above the rim (20 candles). With volume and a break of structure; target = rim + depth.",
